(f) Display of Category wise Seats (Seat Matrix) available for CAP Rounds;
(g) Filling up and Confirmation of Online Option Form having preferences of Courses and
Institutions prior to respective CAP Rounds. Candidates may fill in preferences of
Institutes and Courses in decreasing order of their preference as specified by
Competent Authority. The option form once confirmed shall be considered for
allotment in the respective CAP Rounds;
